# A level's end at its exit spot (LevelExitCheck, 81:872E): with Aladdin
# within 8 pixels of the spot, a level the table at $80:B96B does not mark
# sets his code to PlayerSpotExit (81:CBF9); no play reaches a spot (most
# lie at a level's far end). Level $0A (stage a3 s2), whose spot is at
# x $0CF0, y $0088: the camera put at its right end (x $0C70) and Aladdin
# dropped onto the spot. 13 frames on his code is $CBF9; the song, the
# pose for 128 frames, then PlayerSpotExitFade (81:CC51), whose fade ends
# (TASK2_STATE 0) at frame 175.
# 1. Level $0A's STAGE_GOES_ON entry ($80:C6F2+level) is 1: LevelEndTask
#    (81:CC6B).
# 2. The level ($035E) set to $0B (entry 0) just before frame 175:
#    NextPartTask (81:CC79), which takes the level from the game's
#    progress again.
# 3. The level set to $3A just before frame 175: the first level number
#    whose entry is negative (the game has levels up to $30); the story
#    card (81:CC72), which sets the level to $30 itself and shows act 3's
#    card (LEVEL_035C).
# 4. PlayerSpotExitFade at its own entry (PlayerSpotExit reaches it by a
#    branch, where no call is opened): his code set to $CC51 (the
#    record's P, PC), as the actor loop resumes it, 30 frames into the
#    level: the fade, then LevelEndTask.
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a3_s2.state
wait 30
poke 001777 00,00
poke 0019E9 00,00
poke 001773 70,0C
poke 0019E5 70,0C
poke 0008E7 F0,0C
poke 0008EA 70,00
wait 300
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a3_s2.state
wait 30
poke 001777 00,00
poke 0019E9 00,00
poke 001773 70,0C
poke 0019E5 70,0C
poke 0008E7 F0,0C
poke 0008EA 70,00
wait 174
poke 00035E 0B,00
wait 200
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a3_s2.state
wait 30
poke 001777 00,00
poke 0019E9 00,00
poke 001773 70,0C
poke 0019E5 70,0C
poke 0008E7 F0,0C
poke 0008EA 70,00
wait 174
poke 00035E 3A,00
wait 400
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a3_s2.state
wait 30
poke 0008DD 30,51,CC
wait 120
